Z||000009||Fret Naught||07-31-2000||09:27 AM||||Yup,<BR>You guessed it, spray on bed liner! The bra never really fit tight enough for my taste, and the front end was chipped and cracked real bad, I think the previous owner hit a curb or something, any way one day I got this wild idea, and decided to spray that bed liner on it to cover the mess. I get two reactions, either people stop and say very cool, or they just don't like it. But for a daily driver, and the amount of gravel on the road out here in the winter time, I think it will be real nice. The beauty of it is, I can always put a bra on it to cover it up if I don't like it.<P>The color, I am not sure what it is, there is so much pearl and metal flake in it that when the sun is right it looks almost purple. I believe that Ford used the same stuff on one of their pickups.<BR>DID YOU NOTICE THE CUP HOLDERS!!!!||||reg||12
